      ALSA: hda - New snd-hda-intel model/pin config for hp dv7-4000

Takashi Iwai (3):
      ALSA: hda - Make converter setups sticky
      ALSA: hda - add support for Conexant CX20584
      ALSA: hda - Update model entries in HD-Audio-Models.txt


